# .cursorrules - Sales & Distribution Dashboard (Kohe Kambing App)

## Tech Stack & Architecture
- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (Mobile-first responsive design)
- UI Components: Radix UI / shadcn/ui primitives
- Icons: Lucide React
- State Management: React Context / Zustand for local state & caching
- Storage: LocalStorage / IndexedDB for offline-first sales logging (or Supabase/PostgreSQL backend ready)

## Design & UI/UX Principles (Multi-Platform)
- **Responsive First:** Must look pristine and function smoothly across Mobile (375px+), Tablet (768px+), and Desktop (1280px+).
- **Touch Friendly:** Interactive elements (buttons, inputs, cards) must have adequate touch targets (min 44x44px) for mobile/tablet users in the field.
- **Color Palette:** Natural & Professional Agriculture theme (Forest Green `#166534`, Earth Brown `#78350f`, Cream/Off-white background `#f9fafb`, Slate text).
- **Performance:** Lightweight, fast loading, smooth transitions.

## Code Quality Standards
- Use TypeScript for strict type safety.
- Modular component structure (`/components/ui`, `/components/dashboard`, `/components/sales`).
- Clean separation of business logic (hooks/services) and UI components.
- Write descriptive comments for complex calculation logic (e.g., commissions, inventory turnover, revenue metrics).
